### Scan a pom with well-known vulnerable dependencies (live OSV data)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scans
Content-Type: application/xml

< ./vulnerable-pom.xml

### Scan a pom with current dependencies
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scans
Content-Type: application/xml

< ./clean-pom.xml

### AI triage: what to upgrade first (needs AWS credentials with Bedrock access; costs ~$0.015)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/triage?question=What should I fix this week?
Content-Type: application/xml

< ./vulnerable-pom.xml

### Knowledge base search (phase 3): shows each hit's semantic rank, keyword rank and fused RRF score
# Needs: docker compose up -d postgres, scripts/ingest.sh local, and AWS credentials (the query is embedded by Titan)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/search?q=Text4Shell StringSubstitutor

### A paraphrase with no shared keywords: the semantic half finds it
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge/search?q=moving from javax servlet imports to the new namespace

### Invalid input returns a 400 problem detail
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scans
Content-Type: application/xml

<html/>

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
